  "duration": 36.135,
  "lines": [
    {
      "key": "hook",
      "text": "Fake products might not be perfect, but sometimes they offer surprising advantages over the real thing.",
      "start": 0.35,
      "end": 5.648
    },
    {
      "key": "price",
      "text": "The biggest advantage is price. You can often get a similar look and basic function, without spending nearly as much.",
      "start": 6.048,
      "end": 12.165
    },
    {
      "key": "choice",
      "text": "Fake products can also give you access to styles and designs that might otherwise be too expensive, or difficult to find.",
      "start": 12.565,
      "end": 19.043
    },
    {
      "key": "everyday",
      "text": "For some everyday items, the cheaper alternative may do the job well enough, especially when premium features aren't important.",
      "start": 19.443,
      "end": 26.225
    },
    {
      "key": "end",
      "text": "Of course, quality and safety still matter. But when the risks are low, and the price difference is huge, fake can sometimes make more sense.",
      "start": 26.625,
      "end": 33.935
    }
  ],
